        "Scoring criteria distinguishing high n-Ach from excessive n-Aff",
        "Ring-Toss behavioral simulation to identify calculated moderate risk propensity",
        "Behavioral Event Interview (BEI) testing opportunity seeking, persistence, and information gathering",
